Package: TrajectoryTrees
Type: Package
Title: Construct and Summarize Evolutionary Trajectory Trees
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Sean",
    family = "McHugh",
    email = "sean.mchugh4@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: Constructs phylogenetic trajectory, scenario, and transition
    representations from stochastic character maps. Provides tools for
    selecting output surfaces, processing ensembles in resumable batches,
    summarizing posterior distributions, and plotting trajectory objects.
